{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118359","id":3510609774,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RP6du","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118359/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118359/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118359/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/96b3e8ec7595bbe2381783396556e780690c4bc6","number":118359,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Split inspector property sections into tabs","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12270\r\n* Includes #118358\r\n  * Includes a modified version thereof, which has a technical placeholder. [See comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118359#issuecomment-4223655672). \r\n* Requires #116485\r\n\r\nThis PR implements our 2nd most requested usability feature: editor inspector tabs.\r\n\r\nThe tabs come with a lot of configurability through the editor settings in the `interface/inspector/tabs/` subcategory:\r\n* Can be disabled via `use_inspector_tabs`\r\n* Can be switched between horizontal and vertical via `tab_layout`\r\n* Can show text only/icon only/both via `horizontal_tab_style` and `vertical_tab_style` (split due to different layouts looking better with different modes)\r\n* In vertical layout, they can be on the right/left of the inspector dock tab (static), or on the inside/outside of the inspector dock tab (dynamic) via `vertical_tab_side`\r\n* They can be used either as a list and clicking on the tabs scrolls automatically, or used as fully separate tabs via `tab_property_mode`\r\n* Abstract classes can be merged into the first non-abstract class that inherits them via `merge_abstract_class_tabs`\r\n\r\n<sub> Note: All property names subject to change </sub>\r\n\r\nHere are some snippets:\r\n\r\nHorizontal with both text and icon (default):\r\n<img width=\"545\" height=\"121\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6082e8c8-fc1b-483e-af91-8a2681087bdd\" />\r\n\r\nVertical with icon only (vertical default):\r\n<img width=\"541\" height=\"190\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b95b3d1-dba2-4472-b34f-d025eeb3de25\" />\r\n\r\nTabbed mode:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03843de7-5e79-403a-8f29-f12bcf356941\r\n\r\nJump Scroll mode:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/beb5fa18-c84b-413e-b64f-fb472299244d\r\n\r\n*AI Disclaimer: I used AI to help me figure some of the implementation. Verified it all.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzM